      "created_at": "2021-02-06T05:59:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We noticed playing today that the Unload red ability says “Attack multiple targets ...” but doesn’t say anything about how many targets or how wide an area. (Compare that to, say, Eruption which specifies it attacks three targets.) Is there supposed to be a limit on the number of targets or size of the area of fire with this or is it something that literally can hit an entire scene all at once?&nbsp;</p>",
