      "created_at": "2021-02-06T06:43:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The limit is, well, as many as make sense in the narrative. This could mean that to catch every hostile target, you also have to hit some allies along the way. This is also true for the Green and Yellow damaging AoEs.</p>",
