      "created_at": "2021-02-06T14:23:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cool, that’s how we played it out.&nbsp;So basically Unload is a somewhat uncontrolled burst effect that hits everything in an area more or less, while Eruption only hits a few selected targets so is less powerful but also less risky. Makes sense.</p>",
